<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">LISTEN · NOTICE · TRY</view><view class="title">拼读小练习</view><block wx:if="{{!type}}"><view class="subtitle">不用急着答对，听清楚也是一种进步。</view><button class="unit-card" wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="id" data-type="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseType"><view class="flex"><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.note}}</view></view><text>→</text></button></block><block wx:elif="{{current}}"><view class="muted">第 {{index + 1}} / {{total}} 题</view><view class="card center"><view class="card-title">{{current.prompt}}</view><view wx:if="{{type !== 'listen-word'}}" class="title">{{current.word}}</view><audio-button wx:if="{{current.audioIds.length}}" ids="{{current.audioIds}}" label="听这个词" bind:completed="listened"/></view><button wx:for="{{current.options}}" wx:key="id" class="option {{answered && item.id === current.answerId ? 'correct' : ''}} {{answered && item.id === selected && !correct ? 'incorrect' : ''}}" disabled="{{answered}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="answer">{{item.label}}</button><view wx:if="{{answered}}"><view class="card"><view class="card-title">{{correct ? '你找到它了！' : '再认识一下这个声音'}}</view><view>{{current.explanation}}</view></view><button bindtap="next">{{index + 1 === total ? '看看这次的发现' : '下一题 →'}}</button></view></block><view wx:elif="{{finished}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-star">✦</view><view class="section">完成了 {{total}} 次尝试</view><view class="subtitle">答对 {{score}} 题，继续保持好奇。</view><button bindtap="back">选择另一种练习</button></view><view wx:elif="{{empty}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-star">♫</view><view class="section">这组声音还在准备中</view><view class="subtitle">等发音和题目准备好，就能来挑战了。现在可以先用收藏词卡复习。</view><navigator url="/pages/review/index" class="primary-link">去复习词卡</navigator><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">看看其他练习</button></view></view>
